<title>NETHERLANDS: DELFT INSTR 1996 NET PROFIT NLG 12.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>DELFT INSTR 1996 NET PROFIT NLG 12.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>DELFT, Netherlands 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.76 vs   2.24</p>
<p>    Total net profit		    12.9  vs  16.3</p>
<p>    Net from ordinary operations    13.2  vs   9.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  0.70 vs   0.50</p>
<p>    Turnover			     474.5  vs 472.8</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    31.7  vs  23.1</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gains		 nil   vs   7.0</p>
<p>    Minorities			     0.4  vs   0.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Precision instruments maker Delft Instruments NV had</p>
<p>previously said it expected higher profits from ordinary</p>
<p>operations in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
